TOKEN dashboard_read READ

DESCRIPTION >
    Most recent completed energy snapshot with core settled fields.
    Skips future timestamps and rows that only have null demand/price so a
    just-started period cannot blank the KPI layer.

NODE endpoint
SQL >
    SELECT *
    FROM energy_snapshots AS s FINAL
    WHERE s.timestamp <= now()
      AND s.demand_mw IS NOT NULL
      AND s.price_gbp_mwh IS NOT NULL
    ORDER BY s.timestamp DESC
    LIMIT 1

TYPE endpoint
